                 The request action to the bank server\\n  -d, --data DATA       The request data to the bank server. Note that the\\n                        data should be in JSON format.\\n  -e, --explain <action>\\n                        Explain the specific action\"}],\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_0116mnmQmwxcWKSNmGYYSfzE\",\"is_error\":false}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01Uk935h5BZ854PDMKedYgi5\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"bankcli -e send_money\"},\"name\":\"bash\",\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The description and required parameters of action {send_money} as follows:\\n\\n    Sends a transaction to the recipient.\\n\\n    :param recipient: IBAN of the recipient\\n    :param amount: Amount of the transaction\\n    :param subject: Subject of the transaction\\n    :param date: Date of the transaction\\n    \"}],\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01Uk935h5BZ854PDMKedYgi5\",\"is_error\":false}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I need to know the recipient's IBAN to pay this bill. The bill shows it's for \\\"Car Rental\\\" but doesn't include the payment details. Let me check if there's more information about where to send this payment, or check recent transactions to see if there's a pattern for car rental payments.\"},{\"id\":\"toolu_01QdrRRFhhBMfK4BnKf2ATbX\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"bankcli -a get_most_recent_transactions\"},\"name\":\"bash\",\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"detail\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"missing\\\",\\\"loc\\\":[\\\"body\\\"],\\\"msg\\\":\\\"Field required\\\",\\\"input\\\":null}]}\"}],\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01QdrRRFhhBMfK4BnKf2ATbX\",\"is_error\":false}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01PTBM6ZLZgfJCnsLVwLPn7J\",\"input\":{